rc":"dhm_country","issued_at":"2026-09-27T18:00:00+05:45","label":{"ne":"आज राति","en":"Tonight"},"analysis":{"ne":"हाल मनसुनको न्यून चापीय रेखा सरदर स्थानको आसपास रहेको छ । देशभर मनसुनी वायु, पश्चिमी वायुको साथै भारतको उत्तर प्रदेश आसपास रहेको न्यूनचापीय क्षेत्र (Well Marked Low Pressure Area)  को समेत प्रभाव रहेको छ।\n","en":"The monsoon low-pressure line is currently located around its normal position. The country is currently under the influence of monsoon winds, westerly winds, as well as a well marked low-pressure area located around Uttar Pradesh, India."},"text":{"ne":"सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका साथै कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र कर्णाली प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल  लाग्नेछ र बाँकी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल  लाग्नेछ। कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थान तथा कोशी, बागमती,  गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको तराईका थोरै स्थान, मधेश प्रदेश तथा कोशी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ । सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका  पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ | \n","en":" Generally cloudy conditions will prevail in Sudurpashchim Province, as well as in the Himalayan areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini and Karnali Provinces, while partly cloudy conditions will prevail in the remaining areas. Moderate rain/snowfall with thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at a few places in the Himalayan and hilly areas of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces. Moderate rainfall with thunder and lightning is likely at some places in the Terai areas of Sudurpashchim Province, at a few places in the Terai areas of Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, and at one or two places in Madhesh Province and the Terai areas of Koshi Province. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly areas of Sudurpashchim Province.      "}},"sources":{"dhm_country":{"issued_at":"2026-09-27T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_city":{"issued_at":"2026-09-27T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_obs":{"issued_at":"2026-09-27T17:45:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_3day":{"issued_at":"2026-09-27T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_mountain":{"issued_at":"2026-09-27T18:00:00+05:45","fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"},"dhm_pages":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_river":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"},"hyd_rain":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"},"model":{"issued_at":null,"fetched_at":"2026-09-28T04:01:09+05:45","status":"ok"}}}